    hook: "English spelling can seem wild — why does through not rhyme with though or thought? But beneath the chaos, there are patterns, rules, and strategies that make spelling much more predictable than it appears. Learning these strategies does not just help you spell correctly — it helps you read new words, build vocabulary, and understand how the English language works. Quill the Porcupine is an excellent speller because he studies words, not just memorizes them.",
